"quest_story","story_id":"11236400","schema_version":1,"lang":"kr","texts":{"say:1:1123640001:1":{"text":"요즘 외지인 아가씨에게 반한 블랙하울 부족 청년들이 꽤 많더군요.","source_cn":"最近，有不少黑嚎的年轻人爱上了外族姑娘。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x9A8188949B76499C","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:2:1123640002:1":{"text":"이러한 교류는 환영이지만 적지 않은 문제를 발견했죠...","source_cn":"我很欢迎这种交流，但也发现了不少问题。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x29E8141883B7DCF3","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:3:1123640003:1":{"text":"외지인에게는 독특한 <style=\"highlight\">프러포즈 시험</style>이 있는데, 블랙하울의 젊은이들은 전투만 알지 이런 쪽에는 경험이 없습니다.","source_cn":"比如，外族有一些独特的<style=highlight...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x35C80EBA02FD73F5","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:4:1123640004:1":{"text":"가능하시다면 그들을 지도해주실 수 있겠습니까?","source_cn":"如果方便的话，希望你能指点他们一下。","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0x789431D69E15D9DD","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_target_same","male":"가능하시다면 그들을 지도해주실 수 있겠습니까?","female":"가능하시다면 그들을 지도해주실 수 있겠습니까?","variant_male_record_index":"127965","variant_female_record_index":"127966","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""}},"speakers":{"speaker:克鲁格":{"text":"크루거","source":"克鲁格","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"}},"stats":{"flow_row_count":5,"localized_text_count":4,"speaker_count":1}},"locales/kr/ep1/quest_story/11236420.json":{"asset_key":"ep1/quest_s